Dataset Name: KolektorSDD (Kolektor Surface-Defect Dataset)
Source: https://www.vicos.si/resources/kolektorsdd/
License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Non-Commercial)
Description: 
  - 399 grayscale images of electrical commutator surfaces (plastic embedding)
  - 52 defective, 347 non-defective (severe class imbalance)
  - Image size: width=500 px, height varies 1240~1270 px
  - Annotation: axis-aligned bounding boxes for defects (provided in separate .txt files)
Purpose: Used for industrial defect detection task in this course design.
